PLACEHOLDER FOR COVER LETTER TEMPLATE (.DOCX FILE)

This text file is a placeholder for "Nirajan_CoverLetter.docx" which should be a Microsoft Word document (.docx format).

INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Create your cover letter template in Microsoft Word and save it as "Nirajan_CoverLetter.docx" in this directory
2. Include the following template variables that will be automatically replaced:
   - {{NAME}} - Your full name
   - {{EMAIL}} - Your email address
   - {{PHONE}} - Your phone number
   - {{DATE}} - Current date (automatically formatted)
   - {{JOB_TITLE}} - Position you're applying for
   - {{COMPANY}} - Company name
   - {{LOCATION}} - Job location

EXAMPLE STRUCTURE:
-------------------
{{DATE}}

Dear Hiring Manager at {{COMPANY}},

I am writing to express my interest in the {{JOB_TITLE}} position at {{COMPANY}} in {{LOCATION}}. With my background in data analysis and machine learning, I believe I would be a valuable addition to your team.

[Your customizable middle paragraphs here - these will be enhanced with job keywords]

Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with your needs for the {{JOB_TITLE}} position.

Sincerely,

{{NAME}}
{{EMAIL}}
{{PHONE}}
-------------------

HOW AUTOJOBAGENT USES YOUR COVER LETTER:
- The system will replace all template variables with actual values
- It will analyze job descriptions and identify relevant keywords
- The LLM will enhance your cover letter to include these keywords naturally
- The customized cover letter will be converted to PDF before submission
- If the greeting is generic, it will attempt to customize it with the company name

IMPORTANT FORMATTING TIPS:
- Keep formatting simple and professional
- Use standard fonts like Calibri, Arial, or Times New Roman
- Include clear paragraph breaks
- Start with a generic greeting that can be customized
- Ensure your template has placeholders for your signature and contact information

Replace this placeholder file with your actual cover letter template in .docx format before running AutoJobAgent.
